    "body": "**Related Issues and Documentation**\n\n - [cmd/compile: inefficient code generation on amd64 #40426 (closed)](https://github.com/golang/go/issues/40426) <!-- score=0.84019 -->\n - [cmd/compile: slight reorder of conditions in loop results in much slower code #60611 (closed)](https://github.com/golang/go/issues/60611) <!-- score=0.83106 -->\n - [cmd/compile: eliminate redundant zeroing after lower pass #47107](https://github.com/golang/go/issues/47107) <!-- score=0.83007 -->\n - [cmd/compile: less optimized AMD64 code #24537](https://github.com/golang/go/issues/24537) <!-- score=0.82920 -->\n - [cmd/compile: inefficient assembly code on arm64 #43357](https://github.com/golang/go/issues/43357) <!-- score=0.82885 -->\n - [cmd/compile: regression: unnecessary spilling to the stack #61356 (closed)](https://github.com/golang/go/issues/61356) <!-- score=0.82831 -->\n - [cmd/compile/internal/amd64: huge performance degradation (register allocation issue?) #50821](https://github.com/golang/go/issues/50821) <!-- score=0.82715 -->\n - [cmd/compile: suboptimal arm64 output #43145](https://github.com/golang/go/issues/43145) <!-- score=0.82709 -->\n - [cmd/compile: flagalloc doesn't delete dead instructions #65039](https://github.com/golang/go/issues/65039) <!-- score=0.82623 -->\n - [cmd/compile: inefficient assembly code generated by simple loop\\&branch code #48882](https://github.com/golang/go/issues/48882) <!-- score=0.82583 -->\n\n<sub>(Emoji vote if this was helpful or unhelpful; more detailed feedback welcome in [this discussion](https://github.com/golang/go/discussions/67901).)</sub>\n",
