    "body": "Another option is to represent the carry as 0/-1 instead of 0/1. Then we don't need the `NEGQ` after the `SBBQ`.\r\nThat ship has already sailed for `bits.Add`, but we could have one `NEGQ` each before and after the loop to convert from/to the 0/1 the caller expects.\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
